r `linear_to_srgb` functions to stop the spread of unnecessary clamping to other parts of the code and prevent this sort of issue from happening again in the future.\r\n\r\nThis PR may affect existing projects that depend on this clamping. To achieve the existing behaviour after this PR is merged, simply use the existing `Clamp` visual shader node to clamp to the range of [0, 1].\r\n\r\n| Before PR: background clouds are clipped | After PR: background clouds remain overbright for good tonemapping\r\n--|--\r\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3d76c0d5-e45f-4e26-8bd2-3195d6ddac5a\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b1a8632d-14e4-4cbe-9499-b8d73f7eaadc\" />\r\n\r\nNote: the [HDR output PR](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/94496) will remove clamping from the SMAA shader, but since this change is only needed by the HDR output PR, I'm leaving the behaviour as-is in this PR.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url"